Method 2

$   2  log  _(2 )\(x - 1 \) & = log  _(2 )\(x + 1 \)+ log  _(2 )\(x - 5 \) \  log  _(2 )\(x - 1 \)^(2 ) & = log  _(2 )\(x + 1 \)\(x - 5 \) \  \(x - 1 \)^(2 ) & = \(x + 1 \)\(x - 5 \) \  x ^(2 )- 2  x + 1  & = x ^(2 )- 4  x - 5  \  2  x  & = - 6  \  x  & = - 3  \  therefore  & " no solution "   $

